#. Translators: Title of the dialog that shows the GoPay donation details.
msgid "Informasi Donasi GoPay - Emoji ID"
msgstr "GoPay Donation Details - Emoji ID"

#. Translators: Donation details. {number} is the GoPay phone number, {name} is the account holder.
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Dukungan Pengembang Emoji ID\n"
"\n"
"Metode: GoPay\n"
"Nomor HP: {number}\n"
"Atas nama: {name}\n"
"\n"
"Donasi berapa pun membantu add-on ini terus diperbarui. Terima kasih!"
msgstr ""
"Support the Emoji ID developer\n"
"\n"
"Method: GoPay\n"
"Phone number: {number}\n"
"Account name: {name}\n"
"\n"
"Any amount helps keep this add-on updated. Thank you!"

#. Translators: Button that copies the GoPay number to the clipboard.
msgid "Salin Nomor"
msgstr "Copy Number"

#. Translators: Button that closes the donation details dialog.
msgid "Tutup"
msgstr "Close"

#. Translators: Announced after the GoPay number is copied. {number} is the number.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Nomor GoPay {number} disalin ke papan klip."
msgstr "GoPay number {number} copied to the clipboard."

#. Translators: Announced when the GoPay number could not be copied.
msgid "Gagal menyalin nomor ke papan klip."
msgstr "Could not copy the number to the clipboard."

#. Translators: Button that opens the donation details.
#. Translators: Button in the installation welcome dialog that shows the donation details.
msgid "Donasi"
msgstr "Donate"

#. Translators: Button that closes the donation invitation.
#. Translators: Button in the installation welcome dialog that continues the installation.
msgid "Tidak Sekarang"
msgstr "Not Now"

#. Translators: Title of the welcome dialog shown the first time NVDA starts with Emoji ID.
#. Translators: Title of the welcome dialog shown while Emoji ID is being installed.
msgid "Selamat Datang di Emoji ID"
msgstr "Welcome to Emoji ID"

#. Translators: Message of the welcome dialog shown the first time NVDA starts with Emoji ID.
msgid ""
"Selamat datang di Emoji ID!\n"
"\n"
"Add-on ini membacakan emoji dalam bahasa Indonesia, apa pun suara TTS yang kamu pakai.\n"
"\n"
"Kalau add-on ini bermanfaat, kamu bisa mendukung pengembangnya lewat donasi sukarela melalui GoPay. Pilih Donasi untuk melihat nomornya, atau Tidak Sekarang untuk menutup pesan ini."
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Emoji ID!\n"
"\n"
"This add-on reads emoji in Indonesian, whatever TTS voice you use.\n"
"\n"
"If you find it useful, you can support the developer with a voluntary donation through GoPay. Choose Donate to see the number, or Not Now to close this message."

#. Translators: Title of the periodic donation reminder.
msgid "Dukungan Pengembang - Emoji ID"
msgstr "Support the Developer - Emoji ID"

#. Translators: Message of the periodic donation reminder.
msgid ""
"Semoga Emoji ID membantu aktivitasmu sehari-hari.\n"
"\n"
"Kalau kamu ingin add-on ini terus diperbarui, kamu bisa mendukung pengembangnya lewat donasi sukarela melalui GoPay. Pengingat ini bisa dimatikan di pengaturan Emoji ID."
msgstr ""
"We hope Emoji ID helps you every day.\n"
"\n"
"If you would like this add-on to keep being updated, you can support the developer with a voluntary donation through GoPay. You can turn off this reminder in the Emoji ID settings."

#. Translators: Title of the Emoji ID category in the NVDA settings dialog.
#. Translators: Category of Emoji ID commands in the Input Gestures dialog.
msgid "Emoji ID"
msgstr "Emoji ID"

#. Translators: Checkbox in the Emoji ID settings panel.
msgid "Aktifkan pembacaan emoji dalam bahasa Indonesia"
msgstr "Enable Indonesian emoji reading"

#. Translators: Checkbox in the Emoji ID settings panel.
msgid "Tambahkan kata awalan sebelum nama emoji"
msgstr "Add a prefix word before emoji names"

#. Translators: Label of the edit field for the prefix word in the Emoji ID settings panel.
msgid "Kata awalan:"
msgstr "Prefix word:"

#. Translators: Checkbox in the Emoji ID settings panel.
msgid "Kata awalan hanya sekali untuk emoji berturut-turut"
msgstr "Prefix only once for consecutive emoji"

#. Translators: Checkbox in the Emoji ID settings panel.
msgid "Gabungkan emoji yang sama dan berulang (misalnya '3 kali wajah gembira')"
msgstr "Collapse repeated identical emoji (for example '3 kali wajah gembira')"

#. Translators: Checkbox in the Emoji ID settings panel.
msgid "Sertakan detail warna kulit"
msgstr "Include skin tone details"

#. Translators: Checkbox in the Emoji ID settings panel.
msgid "Bersihkan tanda hubung dan tanda kurung pada nama emoji"
msgstr "Remove hyphens and parentheses from emoji names"

#. Translators: Checkbox in the Emoji ID settings panel.
msgid "Tampilkan pengingat donasi berkala"
msgstr "Show periodic donation reminder"

#. Translators: Button in the Emoji ID settings panel that opens the donation details.
msgid "Dukung Pengembang (Donasi GoPay)..."
msgstr "Support the Developer (GoPay Donation)..."

#. Translators: Description of the command that turns Emoji ID on or off, shown in Input Gestures.
msgid "Aktifkan atau nonaktifkan pembacaan emoji dalam bahasa Indonesia"
msgstr "Turns Indonesian emoji reading on or off"

#. Translators: Announced when Emoji ID is turned on.
msgid "Emoji ID aktif"
msgstr "Emoji ID on"

#. Translators: Announced when Emoji ID is turned off.
msgid "Emoji ID nonaktif"
msgstr "Emoji ID off"

#. Translators: Message of the welcome dialog shown while Emoji ID is being installed.
msgid ""
"Selamat datang di Emoji ID!\n"
"\n"
"Add-on ini membacakan emoji dalam bahasa Indonesia, apa pun suara TTS yang kamu pakai.\n"
"\n"
"Kalau add-on ini bermanfaat, kamu bisa mendukung pengembangnya lewat donasi sukarela melalui GoPay. Pilih Donasi untuk melihat nomornya, atau Tidak Sekarang untuk melanjutkan instalasi."
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Emoji ID!\n"
"\n"
"This add-on reads emoji in Indonesian, whatever TTS voice you use.\n"
"\n"
"If you find it useful, you can support the developer with a voluntary donation through GoPay. Choose Donate to see the number, or Not Now to continue the installation."

#. Translators: Donation details. {number} is the GoPay phone number, {name} is the account holder.
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Metode: GoPay\n"
"Nomor HP: {number}\n"
"Atas nama: {name}\n"
"\n"
"Donasi berapa pun membantu add-on ini terus diperbarui. Terima kasih!"
msgstr ""
"Method: GoPay\n"
"Phone number: {number}\n"
"Account name: {name}\n"
"\n"
"Any amount helps keep this add-on updated. Thank you!"

#. Translators: Added to the donation details after the GoPay number was copied.
msgid "Nomor GoPay sudah disalin ke papan klip."
msgstr "The GoPay number has been copied to the clipboard."

#. Add-on summary/title, usually the user visible name of the add-on
#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
msgid "Emoji ID - Pembaca Emoji Bahasa Indonesia"
msgstr "Emoji ID - Indonesian Emoji Reader"

#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
msgid "Membacakan emoji dalam bahasa Indonesia, apa pun bahasa suara TTS yang dipakai. Mendukung emoji dasar, rangkaian ZWJ, bendera, keycap, dan warna kulit."
msgstr "Reads emoji in Indonesian, whatever language your TTS voice uses. Supports basic emoji, ZWJ sequences, flags, keycaps, and skin tones."

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
msgid ""
"\n"
"- Diperbarui untuk NVDA 2026.3 (CLDR 48.2).\n"
"- Pengingat donasi berkala sekarang nonaktif secara bawaan dan bisa diaktifkan di pengaturan.\n"
"- Dialog sambutan saat instalasi sekarang memakai dialog pesan bawaan NVDA. Memilih Donasi langsung menyalin nomor GoPay.\n"
"- Pengaturan \"Ikuti tingkat simbol NVDA\" dihapus karena belum pernah berfungsi.\n"
"- Terjemahan add-on sekarang dimuat dengan benar.\n"
"- Navigasi per karakter pada bendera tidak lagi membisu: setiap huruf regional dibacakan.\n"
"- Antarmuka add-on sekarang tersedia dalam bahasa Inggris.\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"- Updated for NVDA 2026.3 (CLDR 48.2).\n"
"- The periodic donation reminder is now off by default and can be turned on in the settings.\n"
"- The installation welcome dialog now uses NVDA's built-in message dialog. Choosing Donate copies the GoPay number right away.\n"
"- Removed the \"Ikuti tingkat simbol NVDA\" setting, which never worked.\n"
"- Add-on translations now load correctly.\n"
"- Character navigation on flags is no longer silent: each regional indicator letter is read.\n"
"- The add-on interface is now available in English.\n"
"\t"
